    durationSec: 480,
    description: "Inspired by Viktor Frankl's insights, this practice invites you to confront suffering not as an endpoint, but as an opportunity to discover meaning. Explore your innate freedom to choose your response to any situation, safeguarding your human dignity and inner strength.",
