    category: "inner-work",
    durationSec: 480,
    description: "Inspired by Stoic tradition, this meditation guides you to reflect on mortality not to incite fear, but to cultivate a deeper appreciation for life and to align your actions with what truly matters. Embrace the finite nature of existence to live more fully and virtuously in the present moment.",
